{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112129","id":2956086807,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wMk4X","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112129","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112129.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112129.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112129","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112129/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112129/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112129/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a149280ceab6f49786bd4e0065166c28c5f543ba","number":112129,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"`ClassDB`: Use `AHashMap` for `property_setget` and `constant/signal_map`","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"(During testing I found this is part of #101340, but this is a simple and harmless change that wouldn't require a whole rewrite and has a very low chance of regressions, so I opened it anyway)\r\n\r\n> **Note**: Might conflict with #106646, which also touches the same HashMaps. As long as the proposed `property_cache` is also an `AHashMap`, it's possible to gain around 0.9% more FPS. If anything, that one has priority over this.\r\n___\r\n`ClassDB::get_property()` is one of the biggest bottlenecks in GDScript (actually, in `Variant` itself) as seen when profiling.\r\n\r\nI did a bit of experimenting by making `property_setget`, `constant_map` and `signal_map` `AHashMap` instead of `HashMap`. Tests were run on a modified version of [Gaijin's BunnyMark](https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/godot-das/tree/master/examples/bunnymark) (stress test of many GDScript instances) in a release production build, 3 times, with the average FPS of 20 seconds written down:\r\n\r\n500 bunnies:\r\n\r\n| Build    | Lowest | Highest |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| `master` | 2157   | 2175    |\r\n| PR       | 2320   | 2337    |\r\n\r\n1000 bunnies:\r\n\r\n| Build    | Lowest | Highest |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| `master` | 1445   | 1446    |\r\n| PR       | 1567   | 1582    |\r\n\r\n5000 bunnies:\r\n\r\n| Build    | Lowest | Highest |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| `master` | 311    | 312     |\r\n| PR       | 340    | 349     |\r\n\r\nOverall, FPS was increased between a minimum of 2.8%.\r\n\r\nDuring profiling on a `template_debug` build with debug symbols, `ClassDB::get_property()` almost doubled in cycles, but it was mostly caused by `MethodBindTRC::call()`, which I believe means a bottleneck removed rather than a bottleneck added.\r\n\r\nBuild sizes did not change.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"arc